This product includes software developed by ACINQ SAS.

Vaultovich is a fork of bitcoin-kmp (https://github.com/ACINQ/bitcoin-kmp),
Copyright 2014 ACINQ SAS, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The fork narrows the original Kotlin Multiplatform library to a single Kotlin/JVM
target and adds support for BIP-322 message signing, BIP-352 silent payments,
BIP-370 PSBT v2, BIP-374 DLEQ proofs and BIP-375 silent-payment PSBT fields,
along with output descriptors and MuSig2 key aggregation.
